# FIAL 4 - review already saved government snapshot, without making new requests.
FIAL 4
MISSION "Recheck saved grants and flag unsupported interpretations against exact source fields"
SOURCE VERIFIED_SNAPSHOT
AUDIT SAVED_FIAL2_AND_FIAL3
VERIFY SHA256,RECORD_IDENTITY,FIELD_QUOTES,CLAIM_CONSISTENCY,CONTRADICTIONS
POLICY UNPROVEN_IS_HOLD
END
